Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pregnant women are not factories.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.58,0:00:06.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Babies are not goods to be ordered.
