Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.52,0:00:10.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,There are things in our society, Mr Pritchard,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.60,0:00:12.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,which I believe should never be reduced
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.68,0:00:18.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,to questions around contract and individual choice or intention.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.58,0:00:22.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,And I’m certain that motherhood is one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:27.88,Shape,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(60,1290)\1c&HF48542&\bord0\shad0\fad(120,120)\p1}m 0 0 l 699 0 l 699 78 l 0 78{\p0}
